{
  "$comment": "Canonical public URLs for ZK Nation brand assets. The skill references these so it stays lightweight; heavy assets (fonts, flags, logos) live in the public brandkit repo and the published mirror. If the repo branch/owner changes, update `base`. The `base` repo is PUBLIC and raw.githubusercontent.com serves it with CORS `access-control-allow-origin: *` (verified), so the raw URLs are safe to fetch and to link from a browser. The published here.now mirror is a CDN alternative, also CORS-enabled, preferred for web font linking.",
